 font-medium\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-emerald-400 rounded-full animate-pulse\"></span> Albany, NY · Open Now</div><h1 class=\"demo-fade-up demo-fade-up-1 text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-black leading-[1.05]\">Your Pet&#x27;s<br/><span class=\"text-emerald-400\">Second Home.</span></h1><p class=\"demo-fade-up demo-fade-up-2 text-lg text-white/80 max-w-xl\">Full-service veterinary care and grooming in Albany, NY. Board-certified vets, gentle groomers, and online booking — because your pet deserves the best.</p><div class=\"demo-fade-up demo-fade-up-3 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"relative group inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-7 py-3.5 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-white font-bold rounded-2xl text-base transition-all hover:scale-105\"><span class=\"absolute -inset-1 -z-10 rounded-[inherit] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 blur-md glow-hue-bg\"></span>Book an Appointment</a><a href=\"tel:+15188880001\" class=\"px-7 py-3.5 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 backdrop-blur text-white font-bold rounded-2xl text-base border border-white/20 flex items-center gap-2 transition-all\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384\"></path></svg> (518) 888-0001</a></div></div></section><div class=\"bg-emerald-600 text-white py-8\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 text-center\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px)\"><p class=\"text-2xl font-black\">2,500+</p><p class=\"text-emerald-100 text-sm\">Pets Cared For</p></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px)\"><p class=\"text-2xl font-black\">12yr</p><p class=\"text-emerald-100 text-sm\">In Business</p></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px)\"><p class=\"text-2xl font-black\">4.9★</p><p class=\"text-emerald-100 text-sm\">Google Rating</p></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px)\"><p class=\"text-2xl font-black\">Same-Day</p><p class=\"text-emerald-100 text-sm\">Urgent Appts</p></div></div></div><section id=\"services\" class=\"py-20 bg-[#011410]\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px)\"><span class=\"inline-block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-400 mb-3\">Our Services</span><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-black text-white mb-2\">Everything Your Pet Needs</h2><p class=\"text-white/40\">Comprehensive care under one roof.</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px)\"><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl cursor-pointer transition-shadow duration-300 p-6 h-full flex flex-col\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #10b98128 0%, transparent 60%), #021f18;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);box-shadow:none\"><div class=\"text-4xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\">🩺</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-white mb-2\">Wellness Exams</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-white/50 leading-relaxed flex-1\">Annual checkups and preventive care for dogs, cats, and small animals.</p><div class=\"mt-4 h-px w-8 bg-emerald-400/40 group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-500 rounded-full\"></div></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px)\"><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl cursor-pointer transition-shadow duration-300 p-6 h-full flex flex-col\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #10b98128 0%, transparent 60%), #021f18;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);box-shadow:none\"><div class=\"text-4xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\">💉</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-white mb-2\">Vaccinations</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-white/50 leading-relaxed flex-1\">Core and lifestyle vaccines for dogs and cats, customized to your pet.</p><div class=\"mt-4 h-px w-8 bg-emerald-400/40 group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-500 rounded-full\"></div></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px)\"><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl cursor-pointer transition-shadow duration-300 p-6 h-full flex flex-col\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #10b98128 0%, transparent 60%), #021f18;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);box-shadow:none\"><div class=\"text-4xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\">✂️</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-white mb-2\">Grooming</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-white/50 leading-relaxed flex-1\">Bath, haircut, nail trim, and de-shedding — for all breeds and sizes.</p><div class=\"mt-4 h-px w-8 bg-emerald-400/40 group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-500 rounded-full\"></div></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px)\"><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl cursor-pointer transition-shadow duration-300 p-6 h-full flex flex-col\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #10b98128 0%, transparent 60%), #021f18;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);box-shadow:none\"><div class=\"text-4xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\">🦷</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-white mb-2\">Dental Cleanings</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-white/50 leading-relaxed flex-1\">Professional dental care under anesthesia to keep smiles healthy.</p><div class=\"mt-4 h-px w-8 bg-emerald-400/40 group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-500 rounded-full\"></div></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px)\"><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl cursor-pointer transition-shadow duration-300 p-6 h-full flex flex-col\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #10b98128 0%, transparent 60%), #021f18;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);box-shadow:none\"><div class=\"text-4xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\">🔬</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-white mb-2\">Lab Work &amp; Diagnostics</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-white/50 leading-relaxed flex-1\">In-house bloodwork, urinalysis, and X-rays for fast results.</p><div class=\"mt-4 h-px w-8 bg-emerald-400/40 group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-500 rounded-full\"></div></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px)\"><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl cursor-pointer transition-shadow duration-300 p-6 h-full flex flex-col\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #10b98128 0%, transparent 60%), #021f18;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);box-shadow:none\"><div class=\"text-4xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\">🚨</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-white mb-2\">Emergency Care</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-white/50 leading-relaxed flex-1\">Same-day urgent appointments available. Call us first.</p><div class=\"mt-4 h-px w-8 bg-emerald-400/40 group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-500 rounded-full\"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"our-team\" class=\"py-20 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px)\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-2\">Meet the Team</h2><p class=\"text-gray-500\">People who genuinely love animals. No, really.</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"text-center cursor-pointer\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-40px)\"><div class=\"relative w-24 h-24 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mx-auto mb-4 ring-4 ring-emerald-100\"><img alt=\"Dr. Lisa Park, DVM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data